---
source: crates/rune-config/tests/schema.rs
description: retries on a parallel group
expression: error
---
rune.config.ts is not a valid rune config

script `ci` sets `retries` on a `parallel` group

`retries` describes how one process is run, and a group is not a process — it names the
scripts it runs. Put it on the members it should apply to.
